omes </c><00:00:02.495><c>from  </c><00:00:02.496><c>that </c><00:00:02.497><c>schrodinger's </c><00:00:02.498><c>cat </c><00:00:02.499><c>can </c><00:00:02.500><c>be </c><00:00:02.501><c>dead </c><00:00:02.502><c>and  </c><00:00:02.503><c>alive </c><00:00:02.504><c>at </c><00:00:02.505><c>the </c><00:00:02.506><c>same </c><00:00:02.507><c>time  </c><00:00:02.508><c>although </c><00:00:02.509><c>this </c><00:00:02.510><c>never </c><00:00:02.511><c>actually </c><00:00:02.512><c>happens  </c><00:00:02.513><c>because </c><00:00:02.514><c>of </c><00:00:02.515><c>other </c><00:00:02.516><c>quantum </c><00:00:02.517><c>phenomena  </c><00:00:02.518><c>entanglement </c><00:00:02.519><c>and </c><00:00:02.520><c>decoherence </c><00:00:02.521><c>these </c><00:00:02.522><c>are  </c><00:00:02.523><c>beyond </c><00:00:02.524><c>the </c><00:00:02.525><c>scope </c><00:00:02.526><c>of </c><00:00:02.527><c>this </c><00:00:02.528><c>video  </c><00:00:02.529><c>but </c><00:00:02.530><c>here's </c><00:00:02.531><c>an </c><00:00:02.532><c>excellent </c><00:00:02.533><c>video </c><00:00:02.534><c>on </c><00:00:02.535><c>the  </c><00:00:02.536><c>subject </c><00:00:02.537><c>from </c><00:00:02.538><c>sabine </c><00:00:02.539><c>hosenfelder  </c><00:00:02.540><c>for </c><00:00:02.541><c>those </c><00:00:02.542><c>of </c><00:00:02.543><c>you </c><00:00:02.544><c>who'd </c><00:00:02.545><c>like </c><00:00:02.546><c>to </c><00:00:02.547><c>delve  </c><00:00:02.548><c>deeper </c><00:00:02.549><c>this </c><00:00:02.550><c>video </c><00:00:02.551><c>was </c><00:00:02.552><c>made </c><00:00:02.553><c>possible  </c><00:00:02.554><c>thanks </c><00:00:02.555><c>to </c><00:00:02.556><c>the </c><00:00:02.557><c>kind </c><00:00:02.558><c>support  </c><00:00:02.559><c>of </c><00:00:02.560><c>my </c><00:00:02.561><c>patrons </c><00:00:02.562><c>on </c><00:00:02.563><c>patreon </c><00:00:02.564><c>and </c><00:00:02.565><c>people  </c><00:00:02.566><c>buying </c><00:00:02.567><c>posters </c><00:00:02.568><c